<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RESEARCH ALERT-Pasminco rated 'buy'.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RESEARCH ALERT-Pasminco rated 'buy'.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macquarie Equities Ltd said it was rating Pasminco Ltd a buy as it provided the cleanest and most leveraged exposure globally to an improving zinc market in 1997.</p>
<p>Macquarie said that despite a low zinc price, Pasminco was receiving healthy average price premiums of typically five to 10 percent. Macquarie forecast that Pasminco would see earnings per share grow 110 percent in 1997 and 35 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>Zinc prices should climb to 50 U.S cents a pound in 1997 and 60.5 cents in 1998 against 46 cents in 1996, Macquarie said.</p>
</text>
